  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "回鄉"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>柯淙銘</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">行過人生半途ê風霜</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">倒tńg來久見ê故鄉</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">斯當時</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">故鄉美麗ê田園</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">有青lìng-lìng ê樹　有黃gìm-gìm ê稻</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tī闊bóng-bóng ê田--裡</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">有少年囡仔　自由自在sì-kè走ê跤跡</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">有序大骨力拍拚ê汗</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">汗水透lām田塗ê味</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">是tiâu tī lán骨血ê芳　是刻tī lán心肝ê甘</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一代一代傳承ê記持</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">外鄉人來到tè　侵門踏戶來凌治</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Thún踏lán ê土地　phì-siùnn lán ê田園</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">美麗ê景緻suah來走味</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">塗無koh芳　田suah pha荒　樹仔稻仔tsiâu失色</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lán世代生湠ê底蒂　走去</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0 0 0 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">bih</span></p></blockquote><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Koh徛tī故鄉闊bóng-bóng ê田邊</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">揣無少年囡仔ê跤印　鼻無田塗ê芳甜</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">親像一切lóng失生機</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Mài失志　免稀微</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">回鄉ê lán tio̍h-ài骨力重開墾</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">燒lō ê春風若到位</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Pha荒ê田園ē koh puh新ínn</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">等待伊開花結穗</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">結出lán飽tīnn ê未來</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><a name='more'></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhyoNLKA4zG0riS7efMRbwVwNEZSH65MqM6qvsdH5UL3cOQ3xrM3nidlJxk0JFPr0KUjCHUodcSPJl0bTR7otEVUi9c2fMjudedRljojcdOKaks_e1BbZbKScSnRpxh_G9xYFh0WBER5CYtozxiefEHPWW9Ob7a1RbK2J0JaJgTv0P9mDV-MesV319SiTzh/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1363%E6%9C%9F_5.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhyoNLKA4zG0riS7efMRbwVwNEZSH65MqM6qvsdH5UL3cOQ3xrM3nidlJxk0JFPr0KUjCHUodcSPJl0bTR7otEVUi9c2fMjudedRljojcdOKaks_e1BbZbKScSnRpxh_G9xYFh0WBER5CYtozxiefEHPWW9Ob7a1RbK2J0JaJgTv0P9mDV-MesV319SiTzh/w4